---

import { SITE } from '../config/site';

---



<section

  id="inicio"

  class="relative min-h-[85dvh] sm:min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center pt-20 scroll-mt-20"

>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">

    <img

      src="/img/portada.png"

      alt="Glamping San Francisco - Vista principal"

      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_30%] sm:object-center"

    />

    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/50 mix-blend-multiply dark:bg-neutral-950/70"></div>

    <div

      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-900/40 via-transparent to-transparent"

    >

    </div>

  </div>



  <div class="relative z-10 text-center px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-8 sm:mt-0">

    <span

      class="block text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-medium mb-4 text-sm sm:text-base"

      >Naturaleza & Confort</span

    >

    <h1

      class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-6 drop-shadow-lg leading-tight text-balance"

    >

      Desconecta del mundo,

      <span class="text-neutral-100">conecta contigo.</span>

    </h1>

    <p

      class="text-base sm:text-xl text-neutral-50 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto drop-shadow-md"

    >

      Vive la experiencia de acampar bajo las estrellas con todas las

      comodidades de un resort de lujo en el corazón del bosque.

    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4">

      <a

        href={SITE.airbnbUrl}

        target="_blank"

        rel="noopener noreferrer"

        data-airbnb-link

        data-airbnb-source="hero"

        class="bg-neutral-800 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg hover:bg-neutral-700 transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-xl w-full sm:w-auto text-center min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-white"

      >

        Reservar hospedaje en Airbnb

      </a>

      <a

        href="#experiencias"

        class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white border border-white/30 px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg hover:bg-white/30 transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-xl w-full sm:w-auto text-center min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center"

      >

        Ver experiencias

      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

